{"caseId": "ashare-031", "material": {"title": "1.6T光模块里TEC用量与供需缺口测算", "originalTitle": null, "publishedAt": "2026-10-12T11:30:00+08:00", "sourceName": "雪球", "bodyZh": "按某券商口径假设2027年1.6T出货6000万只，EML路线占30%，每只需8片TEC，则TEC需求约1.44亿片；全球高速光模块用TEC有效产能估约7000万片，缺口近一倍。若涨价10%，弹性最大的是产能占比高的二线厂。假设变量多，仅为推演。", "bodyOriginal": null}, "sourceFacts": {"sourceKind": "external", "sourceTier": "T1_5", "firstParty": false, "language": "zh"}, "samplingContext": {"benchmarkSplit": "holdout", "samplingStratum": "deep_logic"}, "gold": {"decision": "select"}}
{"caseId": "ashare-032", "material": {"title": "深度！一文看懂AI算力十年大周期", "originalTitle": null, "publishedAt": "2026-10-13T12:37:00+08:00", "sourceName": "雪球", "bodyZh": "AI是人类历史上最伟大的技术革命，算力是新时代的石油，未来十年需求将增长一万倍，所有相关公司都会受益。光模块、PCB、液冷、电源、芯片全都有机会，长期持有就能财富自由，这就是时代的贝塔，错过AI等于错过互联网。", "bodyOriginal": null}, "sourceFacts": {"sourceKind": "external", "sourceTier": "T2", "firstParty": false, "language": "zh"}, "samplingContext": {"benchmarkSplit": "development", "samplingStratum": "deep_logic"}, "gold": {"decision": "reject"}}
{"caseId": "ashare-033", "material": {"title": "人形机器人丝杠环节价值量拆解", "originalTitle": null, "publishedAt": "2026-10-14T13:44:00+08:00", "sourceName": "雪球", "bodyZh": "以单台28个线性关节估算，行星滚柱丝杠单价约1500元，单台价值量约4.2万元，占BOM约20%。国产磨床交期12-18个月是扩产瓶颈，所以短期真正受益的是已有磨床储备的厂商，而非刚宣布进入的跨界者。", "bodyOriginal": null}, "sourceFacts": {"sourceKind": "external", "sourceTier": "T1_5", "firstParty": false, "language": "zh"}, "samplingContext": {"benchmarkSplit": "holdout", "samplingStratum": "deep_logic"}, "gold": {"decision": "select"}}
{"caseId": "ashare-034", "material": {"title": "关于PCB涨价周期的一点思考", "originalTitle": null, "publishedAt": "2026-10-15T14:51:00+08:00", "sourceName": "淘股吧", "bodyZh": "最近覆铜板连续两次提价，上游电子布也在涨。历史上PCB涨价周期大概持续3-4个季度，但这次AI板层数高、需求刚性，可能更长。不过需要注意下游消费电子还很弱，普通板未必能跟涨。个人看法，仅供参考。", "bodyOriginal": null}, "sourceFacts": {"sourceKind": "external", "sourceTier": "T2", "firstParty": false, "language": "zh"}, "samplingContext": {"benchmarkSplit": "development", "samplingStratum": "deep_logic"}, "gold": {"decision": "either"}}
