{"caseId": "ashare-037", "material": {"title": "存储涨价对模组厂毛利的传导测算", "originalTitle": null, "publishedAt": "2026-10-13T10:12:00+08:00", "sourceName": "雪球", "bodyZh": "假设DRAM合约价季度涨15%，模组厂库存周转约90天，则涨价首季库存收益可抬升毛利率约4-6个百分点，次季随成本重估回落。因此三季报超预期的模组厂，四季报环比未必延续，追高需谨慎。", "bodyOriginal": null}, "sourceFacts": {"sourceKind": "external", "sourceTier": "T1_5", "firstParty": false, "language": "zh"}, "samplingContext": {"benchmarkSplit": "development", "samplingStratum": "deep_logic"}, "gold": {"decision": "select"}}
{"caseId": "ashare-038", "material": {"title": "我对这个市场的理解", "originalTitle": null, "publishedAt": "2026-10-14T11:19:00+08:00", "sourceName": "淘股吧", "bodyZh": "做股票最重要的是心态，涨了不贪，跌了不怕，跟着趋势走，顺势而为，止损要坚决，止盈要果断，多看少动，耐心等待属于自己的机会。这就是我十年炒股悟出来的道理，写出来和大家共勉，希望对新人有帮助。", "bodyOriginal": null}, "sourceFacts": {"sourceKind": "external", "sourceTier": "T2", "firstParty": false, "language": "zh"}, "samplingContext": {"benchmarkSplit": "development", "samplingStratum": "deep_logic"}, "gold": {"decision": "reject"}}
